# Playwright MCP browser artifacts (screenshots, logs, profile with auth session)
.playwright-mcp/

# Supabase CLI scratch. Today it holds one file caching the CLI's own latest
# version number; it is machine state, not project state.
supabase/.temp/

# Local brand/design-system workspace (assets are copied into the app as needed)
SplitDec DesignSystem/

# Local Claude Code tool config (dev-server launcher for the preview browser)
.claude/

# Launch checklist and security record — deliberately untracked.
# The repo is public. Individually the facts in these are public or derivable
# from the code; aggregated they inventory where the app is weak and
# unmonitored. Kept on the maintainer's machine instead.
GO-LIVE.md
SECURITY.md
# Same class: the implementation plan for the least-privilege database role
# opens by listing exactly what the current credential can reach, which is the
# one paragraph least worth publishing next to the code it describes.
DB-ROLE-PLAN.md

# Pre-launch working material for the buycoffee.to creator profile. Same reason
# as the two files above: the notes alongside the copy record what the app does
# not have yet (backups, point-in-time recovery), and the repo is public.
# Anchored to the root on purpose — an unanchored `buycoffee/` also swallows
# public/buycoffee/, the support button's artwork, which must ship.
/buycoffee/

# Local reporting-style instructions for Claude Code. Personal, not repo policy.
CLAUDE.local.md
